  "$comment": "Refurbished's mail box, front to -z here (its facing names its back). The block is swapped for body (the post, the roof and the box hollowed: a floor, a back, two sides and a top, Refurbished's own boxes and textures turned round, the insides the other side of the same boards) and door (the box's front with its mail slot). body_unchecked has Refurbished's flag up, while the mail is not checked. The door hangs on the line along its bottom front edge (y 11, z 3.5 here); code lets it down level, its inside up. A click on the door opens or shuts it; opening it checks the mail (the flag goes down). The mail lies anywhere on the floor between the walls, flat things on their back. The camera stands in front, a little to the right and 25 degrees up, low enough to see the whole floor under the top through the open front.",
